<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1220px] rounded-[18px] px-4 sm:rounded-[26px] sm:px-8 md:rounded-[30px] md:px-12 py-7 sm:py-9 md:py-12 text-ink"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:gap-11"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:gap-3.5"><p class="font-medium text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.15em] md:tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[25px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.16] md:leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.005em] max-w-[54rem]">Three steps. Nothing to chase.</h2></div><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t-[3px] border-accent pt-5 md:pt-7"><p class="font-display font-num text-[28px] md:text-[34px] font-bold text-accent">1</p><p class="font-display text-[19px] md:text-[22px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-ink">You call, or send the form.</p><p class="text-[15px] md:text-[15.5px] leading-[1.62] text-ink-soft">One sentence about what is wrong. We ask three questions and give you a price band before you hang up.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t-[3px] border-accent pt-5 md:pt-7"><p class="font-display font-num text-[28px] md:text-[34px] font-bold text-accent">2</p><p class="font-display text-[19px] md:text-[22px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-ink">We arrive inside your window.</p><p class="text-[15px] md:text-[15.5px] leading-[1.62] text-ink-soft">You get a text when the van leaves the depot — the plumber’s name, their photo, and a live ETA.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t-[3px] border-accent pt-5 md:pt-7"><p class="font-display font-num text-[28px] md:text-[34px] font-bold text-accent">3</p><p class="font-display text-[19px] md:text-[22px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-ink">You approve the price. Then we fix it.</p><p class="text-[15px] md:text-[15.5px] leading-[1.62] text-ink-soft">Nothing is touched until you have seen the flat rate and said yes. 96% of jobs are finished on that first visit.</p></div></div></div></section>
